                <div style="font-size:12px;font-weight:600;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:3px;">BAGHDAD <span style="font-size:9px;">➤</span></div>
                <div style="font-size:30px;font-weight:300;letter-spacing:-1px;line-height:1;">27°</div>
              </div>
              <div style="font-size:16px;">☁️</div>
            </div>
            <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;font-size:10px;">
              <span style="font-weight:600;">CLOUDY</span>
